-- חוזר הממונה על השכר 2023-1-13 (23.3.2023) — הארכת החופשה המרוכזת של פסח גם
-- ליום 13.4.2023 למעסיקים שמנהיגים חופשה כאמור
-- A one-time extension of the concentrated Pesach leave of 5783 to
-- 13.4.2023, agreed for the coming framework agreement: where it applies,
-- how the day is charged to the leave balance, the notices due by 28.3.2023,
-- the exception for workplaces that must serve the public, and the
-- approvals for other public bodies.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT common

§ `הארכת החופשה המרוכזת של פסח גם ליום 13.4.2023 למעסיקים שמנהיגים חופשה כאמור`

-- akn:hc_1/p1 akn:hc_1/p2 akn:hc_1/p3 akn:hc_1/p4 The date (23.3.2023), the circular's number, the addressees (the public-sector employers) and the subject line; no rule.

DECLARE `Pesach leave party` IS ONE OF
    `the public-sector employer`
    `the employer's director-general`
    `the follow-up committee`

DECLARE `Pesach leave action` IS ONE OF
    `notify the employees of the additional leave day`
    `notify the Wage Controller that the leave cannot be extended`
    `discuss an alternative for the employees`

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in days from the circular's
-- date, 23.3.2023; 28.3.2023 is day 5.
`the circular's date` MEANS Date 23 3 2023
`the notice deadline` MEANS Date 28 3 2023

GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `days from the circular to` d IS
    Day d MINUS Day `the circular's date`

-- §1: the agreement to be signed extends the concentrated Pesach leave to
-- 13.4.2023 for employers that have such a leave; until it is signed, the
-- circular sets out the agreements to act on.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_1
`the additional leave day` MEANS Date 13 4 2023

@desc A workplace, as far as the Pesach 5783 extension asks about it.
DECLARE `workplace` HAS
    `has a concentrated Pesach leave in 5783`              IS A BOOLEAN @desc a concentrated leave over Pesach is customary there in 5783
    `management holds the leave cannot be extended`        IS A BOOLEAN @desc the management holds that the leave cannot be extended because the service to the public must be given
    `the director-general notified the Wage Controller`    IS A BOOLEAN @desc the director-general notified the Wage Controller of it, so that an alternative for the employees can be discussed
    `an approved arrangement makes 13.4.2023 a leave day`  IS A BOOLEAN @desc an arrangement approved according to law already made 13.4.2023 a leave day
    `that arrangement's charge to the employee`            IS A NUMBER  @desc the part of the day that arrangement charges to the employee's leave balance (1 = a whole day)

-- §1(ה): the extension does not apply where the management holds that the
-- leave cannot be extended because the public must be served AND the
-- director-general has notified the Wage Controller.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_e
GIVEN w IS A `workplace`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `excepted under §1(ה)` w IF
        w's `management holds the leave cannot be extended`
    AND w's `the director-general notified the Wage Controller`

-- §1(א): where a concentrated Pesach leave is customary in 5783, it is
-- extended, once, to include 13.4.2023 ("the additional leave day"),
-- unless §1(ה) excepts the workplace.
@export default Whether the concentrated Pesach leave of 5783 at a public-sector workplace includes 13.4.2023 under Wage Controller circular 2023-1-13
@ref akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_a
GIVEN w IS A `workplace` @desc the workplace
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the leave includes the additional day` w IF
        w's `has a concentrated Pesach leave in 5783`
    AND NOT `excepted under §1(ה)` w

-- §1(ב): the additional day is charged 50% to the employee's leave balance
-- and 50% to the employer, unless an approved arrangement already made
-- 13.4.2023 a leave day and charges the employee less, in which case that
-- arrangement's charge applies. Result: the part of a day taken from the
-- employee's balance.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_b
`the employee's half` MEANS 50%

@ref akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_b
GIVEN w IS A `workplace`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the charge to the employee's leave balance` w IS
    IF      `the leave includes the additional day` w
        AND w's `an approved arrangement makes 13.4.2023 a leave day`
        AND w's `that arrangement's charge to the employee` LESS THAN `the employee's half`
    THEN w's `that arrangement's charge to the employee`
    ELSE IF `the leave includes the additional day` w
         THEN `the employee's half`
         ELSE 0

-- §1(ג): the circular changes none of the approved rules and practices of
-- the employer's concentrated leave; the additional day is treated like
-- the other intermediate days of Pesach in the leave, except for §1(ב)'s
-- charge.
DECLARE `day treatment` IS ONE OF
    `as the other intermediate days of the concentrated leave`
    `as §1(ב) charges it`
    `as the workplace's own rules for an ordinary day`

DECLARE `question about the day` IS ONE OF
    `the charge to the leave balance`
    `any other question`

@ref akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_c
GIVEN w IS A `workplace`, q IS A `question about the day`
GIVETH A `day treatment`
DECIDE `how the additional day is treated` w q IS
    IF (NOT `the leave includes the additional day` w)
    THEN `as the workplace's own rules for an ordinary day`
    ELSE CONSIDER q
         WHEN `the charge to the leave balance` THEN `as §1(ב) charges it`
         WHEN `any other question` THEN `as the other intermediate days of the concentrated leave`

-- §1(ד): the employees are told of the additional day by 28.3.2023.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_d
GIVEN w IS A `workplace`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Pesach leave party` `Pesach leave action`
DECIDE `telling the employees` w IS
    IF `the leave includes the additional day` w
    THEN PARTY `the public-sector employer`
         MUST  `notify the employees of the additional leave day`
         WITHIN `days from the circular to` `the notice deadline`
         LEST  BREACH BY `the public-sector employer` BECAUSE "§1(ד): the employees are told of the additional leave day by 28.3.2023"
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- §1(ה), second sentence: the director-general's notice is given as soon as
-- possible and by 28.3.2023 at the latest. Without it the exception does
-- not arise. Modelled as what a management that holds the leave cannot be
-- extended may do to take the workplace out of §1(א).
@ref akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_e
GIVEN w IS A `workplace`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Pesach leave party` `Pesach leave action`
DECIDE `the director-general's notice` w IS
    IF w's `management holds the leave cannot be extended`
    THEN PARTY `the employer's director-general`
         MAY   `notify the Wage Controller that the leave cannot be extended`
         WITHIN `days from the circular to` `the notice deadline`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- §1(ו): a follow-up committee of the Wage Controller and the Histadrut's
-- chairman discusses an alternative for the employees of the workplaces
-- §1(ה) excepts. No date is set; the time is an input.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_f
GIVEN w IS A `workplace`, `the time allowed` IS A NUMBER @desc days for the discussion; the circular sets none
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Pesach leave party` `Pesach leave action`
DECIDE `discussing an alternative` w `the time allowed` IS
    IF `excepted under §1(ה)` w
    THEN PARTY `the follow-up committee`
         MUST  `discuss an alternative for the employees`
         WITHIN `the time allowed`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- akn:hc_1__para_2 The circular was coordinated with the Histadrut, and the parties' agreements on the additional day will form part of the framework agreement to be signed; statements, no rule of their own.

§§ `3 Other public-sector bodies`

DECLARE `other pay agreement` IS ONE OF
    `no other agreement settling pay for 2020-2027`
    `another agreement for part of 1.1.2020-31.12.2027`
    `another agreement for the whole of 1.1.2020-31.12.2027`

@desc A public-sector body other than the State, as far as section 3 asks about it.
DECLARE `public-sector body` HAS
    `will sign or join the framework agreement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `its other pay agreement`                   IS AN `other pay agreement` @desc another collective agreement settling pay rises or financial benefits for 1.1.2020-31.12.2027

DECLARE `approval for the extra day` IS ONE OF
    `the Wage Controller's general approval`
    `a specific approval in advance`
    `no approval under this circular`

-- §3(א): a body that is to sign or will join the framework agreement has
-- the Wage Controller's approval to grant the additional day under this
-- circular. §3(ב): that approval is for a body with no other agreement
-- settling pay for 1.1.2020-31.12.2027; one with another agreement for
-- part of the period needs a specific approval in advance. A body with
-- another agreement for the whole period has neither route, so no approval
-- under this circular.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_a akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_b akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_b/p2
GIVEN b IS A `public-sector body`
GIVETH AN `approval for the extra day`
DECIDE `the approval a body has for the extra day` b IS
    BRANCH IF (NOT b's `will sign or join the framework agreement`) THEN `no approval under this circular`
           IF b's `its other pay agreement` EQUALS `no other agreement settling pay for 2020-2027` THEN `the Wage Controller's general approval`
           IF b's `its other pay agreement` EQUALS `another agreement for part of 1.1.2020-31.12.2027` THEN `a specific approval in advance`
           OTHERWISE `no approval under this circular`

-- akn:conclusions The sign-off (Efi Malkin, acting Wage Controller) and the copies (the Civil Service Commissioner, the Histadrut's chairman, the local-government and regional-council centres, the religious councils, the universities, the Treasury's officials); no rule.

§§ `Examples`

-- 13.4.2023 is the Thursday after the seventh day of Pesach 5783.
#ASSERT `Weekday of` `the additional leave day` EQUALS Thursday
#ASSERT `days from the circular to` `the notice deadline` EQUALS 5

`a ministry with a concentrated leave` MEANS
    `workplace` WITH
        `has a concentrated Pesach leave in 5783`             IS TRUE
        `management holds the leave cannot be extended`       IS FALSE
        `the director-general notified the Wage Controller`   IS FALSE
        `an approved arrangement makes 13.4.2023 a leave day` IS FALSE
        `that arrangement's charge to the employee`           IS 0

`a workplace whose arrangement charges nothing` MEANS
    `workplace` WITH
        `has a concentrated Pesach leave in 5783`             IS TRUE
        `management holds the leave cannot be extended`       IS FALSE
        `the director-general notified the Wage Controller`   IS FALSE
        `an approved arrangement makes 13.4.2023 a leave day` IS TRUE
        `that arrangement's charge to the employee`           IS 0

`a hospital that must serve the public` MEANS
    `workplace` WITH
        `has a concentrated Pesach leave in 5783`             IS TRUE
        `management holds the leave cannot be extended`       IS TRUE
        `the director-general notified the Wage Controller`   IS TRUE
        `an approved arrangement makes 13.4.2023 a leave day` IS FALSE
        `that arrangement's charge to the employee`           IS 0

`a service that did not notify` MEANS
    `workplace` WITH
        `has a concentrated Pesach leave in 5783`             IS TRUE
        `management holds the leave cannot be extended`       IS TRUE
        `the director-general notified the Wage Controller`   IS FALSE
        `an approved arrangement makes 13.4.2023 a leave day` IS FALSE
        `that arrangement's charge to the employee`           IS 0

#ASSERT `the leave includes the additional day` `a ministry with a concentrated leave`
#ASSERT `the charge to the employee's leave balance` `a ministry with a concentrated leave` EQUALS 0.5
#ASSERT `the charge to the employee's leave balance` `a workplace whose arrangement charges nothing` EQUALS 0
#ASSERT NOT `the leave includes the additional day` `a hospital that must serve the public`
#ASSERT `the leave includes the additional day` `a service that did not notify`
#ASSERT `how the additional day is treated` `a ministry with a concentrated leave` `any other question` EQUALS `as the other intermediate days of the concentrated leave`

`a regional council signing the agreement` MEANS
    `public-sector body` WITH
        `will sign or join the framework agreement` IS TRUE
        `its other pay agreement`                   IS `no other agreement settling pay for 2020-2027`
#ASSERT `the approval a body has for the extra day` `a regional council signing the agreement` EQUALS `the Wage Controller's general approval`

-- The employees told on 27.3.2023 (day 4): fulfilled; told on 30.3.2023
-- (day 7): breached.
#TRACE `telling the employees` `a ministry with a concentrated leave` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the public-sector employer` DOES `notify the employees of the additional leave day` AT 4
#TRACE `telling the employees` `a ministry with a concentrated leave` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the public-sector employer` DOES `notify the employees of the additional leave day` AT 7
#TRACE `the director-general's notice` `a hospital that must serve the public` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer's director-general` DOES `notify the Wage Controller that the leave cannot be extended` AT 2
